PointForceLoad;1;408;;1.E+3;0.;0.;1.
# Block 5: a 2 mm gasket (PCOMPLS of one MATG ply over a MAT1 for the
# membrane behaviour) squeezed along its thickness; MATTG makes the membrane
# modulus depend on the temperature. TABLES1 401 is the loading path and 402
# the unloading path (pressure against closure).
IsoMat;41;200.;;0.3;1.5E-9;1.E-4;20.
GasketMat;40;41;0;401;402;;;;;;;;;;30.;1.E+3;50.;0.
GasketMatTemperature;40;403
